      },
      "message": "fix(2d): keep the hull proof to picked contour rings\n\nThe XY hull proof skipped every section, so a whole-model contour on a\nbroken mesh lost its unreadable-section refusal and posted a partial\npath. Use the proof only for picked rings (ladder_picked); the\nwhole-model and unpicked region contours keep the plain ladder.\n\nRefs #3443\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
